"Enter the website address and sign in using the browser dedicated to\n"
"DownAccess that will open. It is separate from your usual browsing:\n"
"you stay signed in for good, and your cookies are reused automatically\n"
"for downloads.\n"
"\n"
"Note: DRM-protected content is not supported."

